        ("Drug shortages", "Hospitals ration scarce drugs (e.g., some chemotherapy) using ethics committees and criteria."),
        ("Ethics committee", "Hospital group that advises on difficult cases and allocation policies."),
        ("Triage officer / team", "Clinicians not caring for the patient apply allocation rules to reduce bias and moral distress."),
        ("Moral distress", "Distress health workers feel when they can't act on what they believe is right, common during rationing."),
